        <body>
            <div xml:id="d26-a9">

                <pb facs="0483" n="473" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv07/pg473"/>

                <head>Annex I</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-11">July 11, 1919</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Telegram From General Franchet
                        d’Esperey to the Minister of War</hi></p>
                <p>On March 27 last I refused the Serbs permission, in advance of a decision by the
                    Peace Conference, to occupy the island of Ada-Kalessi, situated in the Danube to
                    the east of Orsova.</p>
                <p>The Roumanians also claim this island.</p>
                <p>Since the boundary between Serbia and Roumania which’ you communicated to me does
                    not mention this island, I beg that you be so kind as to acquaint me with the
                    decision of the Peace Conference on this point.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
